SUMMARY (for management)
  Threat actors compromised Unitronics Vision Series PLCs at U.S. water
  utilities (including Aliquippa, PA, Nov. 2023) by connecting to internet-
  exposed PLCs on TCP 20256 and logging in with the DEFAULT password ("1111"),
  then defacing the HMI screen. WWP operates ONE Unitronics Vision V570:
  PLC02, the WTP chemical feed controller (sodium hydroxide + chlorine).
  Related guidance also reviewed: CISA AA21-287A (ongoing threats to U.S.
  water and wastewater systems), EPA/CISA "Top Cyber Actions for Securing
  Water Systems", and lessons learned from the Feb. 2021 Oldsmar, FL event
  (remote change of NaOH setpoint from ~100 ppm to 11,100 ppm via remote
  access software).

